WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.039 --> 00:00:05.627
"We should sneak back to the cave," Zella said again, picking at her flower noodles.

2
00:00:05.628 --> 00:00:08.989
She and Raff were eating lunch outside their house.

3
00:00:08.990 --> 00:00:12.916
Raff shook his head. "You heard what the mayor said.

4
00:00:12.917 --> 00:00:17.235
We're not supposed to go near it. Or the wormhole either."

5
00:00:17.236 --> 00:00:20.999
"What if there's another entrance to the cave?" Zella said.

6
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.316
"The grown-ups didn't even look for one!

7
00:00:23.317 --> 00:00:27.650
Somebody could have stolen that relic and whisked it away through the wormhole."

8
00:00:27.651 --> 00:00:32.665
"It's odd that none of the adults knew about the wormhole," Raff said.

9
00:00:32.666 --> 00:00:35.212
"I wonder how long it's been there."

10
00:00:35.213 --> 00:00:39.916
"Nobody goes to that part of the forest except for us. Anyway . . ."

11
00:00:39.917 --> 00:00:42.624
Zella shot a look at her brother.

12
00:00:42.625 --> 00:00:46.468
"Zann and his friends wouldn't give up on an adventure like this.

13
00:00:46.469 --> 00:00:49.738
Not even if the adults got in their way."

14
00:00:49.739 --> 00:00:54.103
"Maybe." Raff sipped his airberry juice.

15
00:00:54.104 --> 00:00:58.134
"But they're heroes, and we're just regular kids."

16
00:00:58.135 --> 00:01:03.027
Zella shook her head, staring at the hat covering her brother's red hair.

17
00:01:03.028 --> 00:01:08.916
Raff wasn't exactly a "regular" kid. He was a Red, just like Zann.

18
00:01:08.917 --> 00:01:13.033
The problem was that her brother didn't like using magic.

19
00:01:13.034 --> 00:01:16.845
If he practiced more often, he could get a lot better at it.

20
00:01:16.846 --> 00:01:21.599
Just then a sudden movement near the edge of the forest caught her eye.

21
00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:25.955
"Wait. Is that Loro? Is he heading for the trail?"

22
00:01:25.956 --> 00:01:28.754
Before Raff could answer, she jumped up.

23
00:01:28.755 --> 00:01:33.624
"I think he's sneaking to the cave! Let's find him and see what he's doing."

24
00:01:33.625 --> 00:01:38.749
Raff looked surprised. "He didn't tell us he was going back.

25
00:01:38.750 --> 00:01:41.874
And he seemed kind of nervous in the cave."

26
00:01:41.875 --> 00:01:47.243
"Come on, Raff!" Zella pulled her brother up and they hurried toward the trail.

27
00:01:47.244 --> 00:01:52.543
But as they drew closer, she saw a man roping off the trail entrance.

28
00:01:52.544 --> 00:01:55.416
"Uh-oh," Raff said.

29
00:01:55.417 --> 00:02:02.270
"I bet the mayor wants to make sure that nobody takes this trail to the cave. She thinks it's not safe."

30
00:02:02.271 --> 00:02:08.667
"Darn," Zella thought. "We could try zapping to the cave, but we might not find Loro."

31
00:02:08.668 --> 00:02:12.861
She had an idea. "Wait here. I'll be right back."

32
00:02:12.862 --> 00:02:18.329
Zella ran back home. She found Muncher grazing in the neighbor's yard.

33
00:02:18.330 --> 00:02:20.957
She whistled for him to follow her.

34
00:02:20.958 --> 00:02:25.464
Soon she and Raff were approaching the man with the donkey following them.

35
00:02:25.465 --> 00:02:28.282
The man held up a hand to stop them.

36
00:02:28.283 --> 00:02:33.874
"Sorry, kids. Mayor Ruxton doesn't want anyone going past this point.

37
00:02:33.875 --> 00:02:36.851
Not until we figure out if that cave is safe.

38
00:02:36.852 --> 00:02:42.332
We also have to block off the wormhole so nobody stumbles into it accidentally."

39
00:02:42.333 --> 00:02:48.306
Zella smiled innocently. "Oh, don't worry. We aren't going near that cave.

40
00:02:48.307 --> 00:02:52.405
We're just taking our donkey out to eat the new patch of sprinkle thistles."

41
00:02:52.406 --> 00:02:56.975
"Sprinkle thistles?" The man looked surprised.

42
00:02:56.976 --> 00:03:00.259
"I thought your donkey already ate those."

43
00:03:00.260 --> 00:03:04.486
Zella thought fast. "Someone found another patch of them.

44
00:03:04.487 --> 00:03:10.481
The mayor asked us to take Muncher to it right away." She felt guilty for lying.

45
00:03:10.482 --> 00:03:14.499
She wondered if Zann and his friends ever lied to adults.

46
00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:18.754
But the story worked! The man let them pass.

47
00:03:18.755 --> 00:03:22.733
As soon as he was out of sight, the kids turned toward the cave.

48
00:03:22.734 --> 00:03:28.259
Raff suddenly seemed anxious. "This isn't a good idea, Zella.

49
00:03:28.260 --> 00:03:32.129
The staff is gone, so there's nothing for us to do.

50
00:03:32.130 --> 00:03:38.668
And Loro was probably just exploring the forest or something. We'll never find him."

51
00:03:38.669 --> 00:03:44.043
"Wrong!" Zella said with a grin. "Loro's right up there."

52
00:03:44.044 --> 00:03:50.832
When they caught up to him, Loro looked startled. "Oh! You two are here too."

53
00:03:50.833 --> 00:03:53.466
"You inspired us," Zella said.

54
00:03:53.467 --> 00:03:58.157
"We saw you slip into the forest and wondered if you were going to try to sneak into the cave."

55
00:03:58.158 --> 00:04:01.499
"I'm glad you came," Loro said.

56
00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:04.769
"It's safer if we all go inside the cave.

57
00:04:04.770 --> 00:04:08.082
And I was just going to look around a little bit more.

58
00:04:08.083 --> 00:04:14.652
I mean, it's not likely, but what if a wild animal carried that relic off to another part of the cave?

59
00:04:14.653 --> 00:04:19.434
Everyone could be worried about its disappearance for no reason."

60
00:04:19.435 --> 00:04:26.499
"Hmm." Zella was doubtful. "I guess that's possible, but . . ."

61
00:04:26.500 --> 00:04:29.588
"Come on, let's go," Loro said.

62
00:04:29.589 --> 00:04:36.476
They headed into the cave. Once again Muncher turned back when the tunnel got too narrow.

63
00:04:36.477 --> 00:04:40.871
But the three kids were able to squeeze through several new passages.

64
00:04:40.872 --> 00:04:45.832
They found a few more rooms. But there was no sign of the staff anywhere.

65
00:04:45.833 --> 00:04:51.916
"Now what?" Raff asked as they held up their lights to look around a small chamber.

66
00:04:51.917 --> 00:04:54.374
"We haven't explored the whole cave yet."

67
00:04:54.375 --> 00:04:59.296
Zella pointed to an opening in the far wall. "Let's go that way."

68
00:04:59.297 --> 00:05:02.043
They stepped into a new tunnel.

69
00:05:02.044 --> 00:05:05.832
It was wide enough for the three of them to walk side by side.

70
00:05:05.833 --> 00:05:10.874
The ceiling was so high that Zella couldn't see it in the dim light.

71
00:05:10.875 --> 00:05:13.916
"Brighter," she said, snapping her fingers.

72
00:05:13.917 --> 00:05:17.624
Her light grew brighter but not by much.

73
00:05:17.625 --> 00:05:22.749
Raff noticed what she was doing. "It's hard to do magic down here.

74
00:05:22.750 --> 00:05:26.000
I wonder if that's normal in caves.

75
00:05:26.001 --> 00:05:31.254
Or maybe there's some sort of—ahh!" He pitched forward, arms flailing.

76
00:05:31.255 --> 00:05:36.522
"Raff!" Zella cried. She grabbed his shirt and hauled him back.

77
00:05:36.523 --> 00:05:41.416
At the same time, one of her feet slid off the edge of a drop-off.

78
00:05:41.417 --> 00:05:45.416
She jumped back just in time to keep from falling.

79
00:05:45.417 --> 00:05:47.512
[i@Hiss!@i]

80
00:05:47.513 --> 00:05:52.514
Loro stood frozen. "What's that noise?"

81
00:05:52.515 --> 00:05:59.212
Zella leaned forward. She and her brother had almost fallen into another deep hole.

82
00:05:59.213 --> 00:06:02.736
But unlike the previous one, this one wasn't empty.

83
00:06:02.737 --> 00:06:08.537
A mass of slender shapes writhed at the bottom, making a loud hissing sound!

84
00:06:08.538 --> 00:06:11.308
Zella recognized the creatures immediately.

85
00:06:11.309 --> 00:06:15.954
They were among the most dangerous animals in Magica.

86
00:06:15.955 --> 00:06:20.913
"It's a whole nest of cave vipers!" she said, her voice shaking.

87
00:06:20.914 --> 00:06:25.118
"And we almost fell down there with them!"

